OL,3,AAt least 68 killed in Spanish
OL,4,Ahigh-speed train crash, as prime
OL,5,Aminister says 'whole country is
OL,6,Agrieving'
OL,7,
OL,8,FAt least 68 people have been killed
OL,9,Fafter a Spanish high-speed train
OL,10,Fcollided with another train south of
OL,11,Fthe capital Madrid
OL,13,FThe updated death toll makes this crash
OL,14,Fthe country's worst rail disaster since
OL,15,F2013
OL,17,FSpain's transport minister says an
OL,18,F"inexplicable" decision by the control
OL,19,Fcentre led to the collision after a
OL,20,Fcomputer failure initially caused
OL,21,Ftrains to halt
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
